om2
note tools/gen/protocol/gencheck.om -- strict validator of the GEN protocol manifest (aien-spark/omega#476).
note Manifest: tests/one_layer/generalization/protocol.json (schema omega.gen.protocol.v1), the machine copy of
note docs/one_layer/GEN_PROTOCOL_V1.md. Family rules: tests/one_layer/generalization/families/FAMSIG_V1.md,
note through famsig_lib.om (the same code as famsig). Pure OM-2 port of tools/gen/protocol/gencheck.c (which
note stays as the protocol-pinned C reference). Unit: seed/ng/sha256.om + famsig_lib.om + this file.
note Deterministic: no clock, no randomness, no environment.
note
note   gencheck manifest <protocol.json> <root>
note   gencheck run-ready <protocol.json> <root>
note   gencheck open <protocol.json> <root> <OPEN>
note   gencheck split <protocol.json> <root> <SPLIT> <HELDOUT.pub>
note Output: "ok ..." lines on stdout, then "GENCHECK PASS" (exit 0). A refusal prints "gencheck: FAIL <reason>"
note on stderr and "GENCHECK FAIL" on stdout (exit 1). Usage errors exit 2.

text gc_t_usage "usage: gencheck manifest <protocol.json> <root> | run-ready <protocol.json> <root> | open <protocol.json> <root> <OPEN> | split <protocol.json> <root> <SPLIT> <HELDOUT.pub>\n"
