note schema omega.gen.protocol.v1: one "<normalised path> <allowed types>" per line (o a s i n b z)
text gc_schema "- o\nschema s\nrevision i\nissue s\ndoc s\nquestion s\nconfig o\nconfig.name s\nconfig.params s\nconfig.masking b\nconfig.harness_kind s\nconfig.writer s\nconfig.reader s\nconditions a\nconditions[] o\nconditions[].name s\nconditions[].prefix_examples i\nconditions[].retrieval s\nretrieval o\nretrieval.contract s\nretrieval.record_schema s\nretrieval.k i\nretrieval.cap_bytes i\nretrieval.mode s\nretrieval.query s\nretrieval.c_pool_excludes_prefix b\nretrieval.length_match_abs_bytes i\nretrieval.length_match_frac n\nretrieval.length_match_min_matched_frac n\ngeneration o\ngeneration.primary s\ngeneration.max_tokens i\ngeneration.max_rounds i\ngeneration.attempts i\ngeneration.attempt1_temperature i\ngeneration.sampled_temperature n\ngeneration.sampled_top_p n\ngeneration.seed_base i\ngeneration.seed_attempt_stride i\ngeneration.retries i\ngeneration.retry_pause_s i\ngeneration.order s\ngeneration.sets a\ngeneration.sets[] s\ngates o\ngates.greedy o\ngates.greedy.tasks s\ngates.greedy.condition s\ngates.greedy.repeats i\ngates.g0 o\ngates.g0.script s\ngates.g0.task s\ngates.g0.condition s\ngates.g0.seeds i\ngates.g0.repeat i\ngates.g0.otherwise s\ngates.g0.seed_values a\ngates.g0.seed_values[] i\ngeneration.in_flight i\ndecision o\ndecision.schema s\ndecision.primary s\ndecision.controls a\ndecision.controls[] s\ndecision.delta n\ndecision.alpha n\ndecision.test s\ndecision.ci s\ndecision.z95 n\ndecision.z90 n\ndecision.fail_control s\ndecision.sanity_ab_max i\ndecision.verdicts a\ndecision.verdicts[] s\ndecision.vectors s\ndecision.floor_max i\ndecision.ceiling_min i\nsplits o\nsplits.dev o\nsplits.dev.count i\nsplits.dev.meta s\nsplits.dev.meta_sha256 s\nsplits.dev.cases s\nsplits.dev.pack_sha256 s\nsplits.dev.tasks a\nsplits.dev.tasks[] s\nsplits.dev.families a\nsplits.dev.families[] s\nsplits.corpus o\nsplits.corpus.count_target i\nsplits.corpus.meta s\nsplits.corpus.meta_sha256 sz\nsplits.heldout o\nsplits.heldout.count i\nsplits.heldout.min_families i\nsplits.heldout.pub_sha256 sz\nsplits.heldout.tasks_sha256 sz\nsplits.heldout.near_dup_threshold n\nrecord_sets o\nrecord_sets.prefix_ids az\nrecord_sets.prefix_ids[] s\nrecord_sets.prefix_sha256 sz\nrecord_sets.raw_manifest_sha256 sz\nrecord_sets.abstraction_manifest_sha256 sz\nrecord_sets.raw_manifest sz\nrecord_sets.abstraction_manifest sz\npins a\npins[] o\npins[].path s\npins[].sha256 s\ninterfaces a\ninterfaces[] o\ninterfaces[].name s\ninterfaces[].path s\ninterfaces[].commit s\ninterfaces[].sha256 s\n"
note frozen v1 values: one "<path>\t<raw>" per line; any other value is a change that needs a new revision
text gc_fixed "schema\tomega.gen.protocol.v1\nrevision\t1\nissue\taien-spark/omega#476\ndoc\tdocs/one_layer/GEN_PROTOCOL_V1.md\nconfig.name\tA\nconfig.params\ttools/exp445/PARAMS\nconfig.masking\tfalse\nconfig.harness_kind\toscir\nconfig.writer\tomegese\nconfig.reader\ttools/exp445/reader.sh\nconditions[0].name\tA\nconditions[0].prefix_examples\t1\nconditions[0].retrieval\tnone\nconditions[1].name\tB\nconditions[1].prefix_examples\t14\nconditions[1].retrieval\tnone\nconditions[2].name\tC\nconditions[2].prefix_examples\t14\nconditions[2].retrieval\traw\nconditions[3].name\tD\nconditions[3].prefix_examples\t14\nconditions[3].retrieval\tabstraction\nretrieval.contract\tgenret-cli-v3\nretrieval.record_schema\tgen-record-1\nretrieval.k\t3\nretrieval.cap_bytes\t4096\nretrieval.mode\tnormal\nretrieval.query\trequirement+prompt\nretrieval.c_pool_excludes_prefix\ttrue\nretrieval.length_match_abs_bytes\t256\nretrieval.length_match_frac\t0.15\nretrieval.length_match_min_matched_frac\t0.5\ngeneration.in_flight\t1\ngeneration.primary\tattempt1_round1_functional\ngeneration.max_tokens\t3072\ngeneration.max_rounds\t2\ngeneration.attempts\t3\ngeneration.attempt1_temperature\t0\ngeneration.sampled_temperature\t0.7\ngeneration.sampled_top_p\t0.8\ngeneration.seed_base\t476000\ngeneration.seed_attempt_stride\t1000\ngeneration.retries\t2\ngeneration.retry_pause_s\t5\ngeneration.order\tattempt,task,condition\ngeneration.sets[0]\t<c>-<attempt>\ngeneration.sets[1]\t<c>-<attempt>-final\ngates.greedy.tasks\tdev\ngates.greedy.condition\tB\ngates.greedy.repeats\t2\ngates.g0.script\ttools/exp445/sampling-gate.sh\ngates.g0.task\tdevgen01\ngates.g0.condition\tB\ngates.g0.seeds\t8\ngates.g0.repeat\t1\ngates.g0.otherwise\tUNAVAILABLE\ngates.g0.seed_values[0]\t476901\ngates.g0.seed_values[1]\t476902\ngates.g0.seed_values[2]\t476903\ngates.g0.seed_values[3]\t476904\ngates.g0.seed_values[4]\t476905\ngates.g0.seed_values[5]\t476906\ngates.g0.seed_values[6]\t476907\ngates.g0.seed_values[7]\t476908\ndeci